{"ticker":"PEP","updated":"2026-11-27T23:14:59Z","profile":{"longName":"PepsiCo, Inc.","shortName":"Pepsico, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pepsico.com","fullTimeEmployees":306000,"marketCap":197052366848,"trailingPE":18.18868,"forwardPE":16.825968,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0058057,"pegRatio":2.82,"targetMeanPrice":141.27274,"targetHighPrice":165.0,"targetLowPrice":106.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.056,"earningsGrowth":0.174,"grossMargins":0.54327,"operatingMargins":0.16046,"profitMargins":0.11091,"totalRevenue":98241003520,"beta":0.321,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":171.48,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":123.47,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.11},"summary":"PepsiCo, Inc. engages in the manufacture, marketing, distribution, and sale of various beverages and convenient foods worldwide. The company operates through six segments: PepsiCo Foods North America; PepsiCo Beverages North America; International Beverages Franchise; Europe, Middle East and Africa; Latin America Foods; and Asia Pacific Foods. It offers cereals, chips, dips, granola bars, oatmeal, pasta, rice, and syrups and mixes; refrigerated dips and spreads; beverage concentrates, fountain syrups, and finished goods; and ready-to-drink tea and coffee products. The company also provides SodaStream sparkling water makers and related products, as well as various dairy products under the Agusha, Chudo, and Domik v Derevne brands. It serves wholesale and other distributors, foodservice customers, grocery stores, drug stores, convenience stores, discount/dollar stores, mass merchandisers, membership stores, hard discounters, e-commerce retailers and authorized independent bottlers, and others through a network of direct-store-delivery, customer warehouse, and distributor networks, as well as directly to consumers through e-commerce platforms and retailers. PepsiCo, Inc. was founded in 1898 and is based in Purchase, New York.","summary_zh":"百事可樂公司在全球從事各種飲料和方便食品的製造、行銷、分銷和銷售。該公司透過六個部門運作：百事食品北美分部；百事可樂飲料北美；國際飲料特許經營；歐洲、中東和非洲；拉丁美洲食品；和亞太食品。它提供穀物、薯片、蘸醬、格蘭諾拉麥片、燕麥片、麵食、大米、糖漿和混合物；冷藏蘸醬和塗抹醬；濃縮飲料、噴泉糖漿和成品；以及即飲茶和咖啡產品。該公司還提供 SodaStream 氣泡水機和相關產品，以及 Agusha、Chudo 和 Domik v Derevne 品牌的各種乳製品。該公司透過直營店送貨網路、客戶倉庫和分銷商網路，為批發商和其他分銷商、食品服務客戶、雜貨店、藥店、便利店、折扣/一元店、量販店、會員商店、硬折扣店、電子商務零售商和授權獨立裝瓶商等提供服務，並透過電子商務平台和零售商直接向消費者提供服務。百事可樂公司成立於 1898 年，總部位於紐約州普切斯。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 非酒精類","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":140.44,"h":140.67,"l":139.12,"c":140.17,"v":11930200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":140.17,"h":141.03,"l":139.83,"c":140.44,"v":7583400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":140.81,"h":143.37,"l":140.48,"c":143.14,"v":5880800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":141.89,"h":143.25,"l":141.37,"c":142.31,"v":4497300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":142.26,"h":143.36,"l":141.86,"c":141.98,"v":5425700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":141.77,"h":141.85,"l":138.88,"c":139.7,"v":6750700},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":140.37,"h":141.84,"l":139.69,"c":140.79,"v":6110300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":140.79,"h":140.98,"l":138.69,"c":138.84,"v":8256700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":140.46,"h":144.74,"l":138.59,"c":144.71,"v":13706600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":145.63,"h":150.82,"l":145.0,"c":150.08,"v":17545200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":148.65,"h":149.98,"l":147.34,"c":148.89,"v":7272000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":148.69,"h":151.62,"l":148.5,"c":151.54,"v":8371100},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":151.33,"h":152.39,"l":149.17,"c":151.16,"v":6101100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":152.38,"h":154.38,"l":152.29,"c":152.67,"v":8532900},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":153.77,"h":153.91,"l":151.74,"c":153.71,"v":6710100},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":154.42,"h":154.42,"l":152.72,"c":153.64,"v":4810600},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":154.7,"h":155.19,"l":152.84,"c":153.18,"v":5614300},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":153.15,"h":155.18,"l":152.71,"c":153.03,"v":6486000},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":153.17,"h":153.4,"l":151.03,"c":151.51,"v":6091800},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":152.04,"h":152.42,"l":151.27,